  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/pes/505",
  "definition": "Notification of Spraying in Rights-of-Way",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-08-22",
  "historyNote": "#150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; amd by #4031, eff 4-1-86; amd by #4185, eff 12-9-86; ss by #4866, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #6698, eff 2-28-98; amd by #7341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-7-00 EXPIRED: 2-3-01 New. #7553, eff 9-5-01; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #9712-B, eff 5-11-10; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #12122, eff 2-28-17; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
